  <p id="c-liangshu-027-daoqia-ming-beiyan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-daoqia-ming-beiyan:p001:m0000" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA">明山賓</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-027-daoqia-ming-beiyan:p001:m0004" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA">孝若</persName>，平原鬲人也。父<persName id="c-liangshu-027-daoqia-ming-beiyan:p001:m0014" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AA">僧紹</persName>，隱居不仕，宋末國子博士徵，不就。</p>
